<title>SPAIN: SOCCER-SUMMARIES IN THE SPANISH FIRST DIVISION.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-SUMMARIES IN THE SPANISH FIRST DIVISION.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-09-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish first division summaries</p>
<p>on Saturday:</p>
<p>Real Betis 1 (Robert Jarni 2nd minute) Deportivo Coruna 2</p>
<p>(Rivaldo 70th, Mickael Madar 80th). Halftime 1-0. Attendance</p>
<p>46,000.</p>
<p>Espanyol 5 (Jordi Lardin 18th, 45th, Goran Bogdanovic 37th,</p>
<p>Miguel Angel Benitez 65th, Nenad Pralija 70th) Extremadura 1</p>
<p>(Ito Alvarez 77th). 3-0. 16,000.</p>
<p>Racing Santander 1 (Bestchasnich 28th) Athletic Bilbao 2</p>
<p>(Ismael Urzaiz 41st, Jose Ziganda 70th). 1-1. 18,000.</p>
<p>Real Sociedad 0 Valladolid 0. 21,000.</p>
</text>
